<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25</p>
<p>higher. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   58.50, some 59.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   58.00-58.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   57.00-58.00</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   56.00-57.00</p>
<p>	    290-300 lbs   55.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows 300-400 lbs steady to 0.50 higher; 400-650 lbs steady to</p>
<p>0.50 lower. Top 55.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-400 lbs    49.50</p>
<p>	    400-450 lbs    50.50-51.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    51.50-52.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    52.50-55.00</p>
</text>
